# Host names allowed to open ElasticPro. Generated, not hand-written.
#
# deploy.sh --apply-config writes config-txt.conf here from ALLOWED_DOMAINS in
# deploy/config.txt: `<name> 1;` for each listed name, then a final regex that refuses any
# other. Edit config.txt, not this file.
#
# Empty directory (the default): any name is accepted. The Zabbix sign-in and pairing
# routes are never subject to this.
